<p>
  {dgettext("help_games", "Anybody can watch a match whose seat was offered to everybody.")}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_watching}>{dgettext("help_games", "Watching a Match")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_games", "When somebody takes the seat, the card shows a Watch button.")}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "Watching opens in a tab of its own.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "You do not need an account to watch.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Watching only shows the game. It never shows the call or the files of the players."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "Nobody can watch a private match.")}</li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_watching}>{dgettext("help_games", "What Watching Shows")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The page shows the game as it is played, the names of both players and whether the match is live."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Between two games the page waits, and the next game starts on its own."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Below the game there is a link to play it yourself and a link to its channel."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "After a match, the page lists other matches to watch.")}</li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_watching}>{dgettext("help_games", "Where to Find a Match")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "You can also find a live match in the channel of its game.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "The page of a game also lists the matches being played now.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "In the game room, an arcade machine lists the matches of its game being played now."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_watching}>{dgettext("help_games", "While Playing")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "Players can see how many people are watching their match.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "They can also copy the link to their match.")}</li>
</ul>

<p>
  {dgettext("help_games", "See also:")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-game-channels">{dgettext("help_games", "Game Channels")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-lfg">/lfg</.help_link>
</p>
